{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 79,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "79:1",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "By those [angels] who extract with violence",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:2",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And [by] those who remove with ease",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:3",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:4",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And those who race each other in a race",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:5",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "And those who arrange [each] matter,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:6",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:7",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "There will follow it the subsequent [one].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:8",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "Hearts, that Day, will tremble,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:9",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "Their eyes humbled.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:10",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:11",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Even if we should be decayed bones?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:12",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:13",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "Indeed, it will be but one shout,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:14",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:15",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "Has there reached you the story of Moses? -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:16",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Ṭuwā,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:17",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "\"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:18",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:19",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]?'\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:20",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "And he showed him the greatest sign,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:21",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "But he [i.e., Pharaoh] denied and disobeyed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:22",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "Then he turned his back, striving [i.e., plotting].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:23",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "And he gathered [his people] and called out",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:24",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "And said, \"I am your most exalted lord.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:25",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "So Allāh seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression]..",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:26",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "Indeed in that is a lesson [i.e., warning] for whoever would fear [Allāh].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:27",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? He [i.e., Allāh] constructed it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:28",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "He raised its ceiling and proportioned it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:29",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:30",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "And after that He spread the earth.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:31",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "He extracted from it its water and its pasture,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:32",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "And the mountains He set firmly",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:33",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "As enjoyment [i.e., provision] for you and your grazing livestock.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:34",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:35",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "The Day when man will remember that for which he strove,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:36",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:37",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "So as for he who transgressed",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:38",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "And preferred the life of the world,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:39",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:40",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:41",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:42",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "They ask you, [O Muḥammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:43",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "In what [position] are you that you should mention it?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:44",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "To your Lord is its finality.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:45",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "You are only a warner for those who fear it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "79:46",
      "surahNumber": 79,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
